<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28879" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Messēnē</span></b> ,
		ēs, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Messēna</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Messāna</span></b> ),
		ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μεσσήνη</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the capital of Messenia, in the Peloponnesus, on the
				river Pamisos</i>, now <i>Maura-Matia</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3,
			4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 5, 7, § 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Nep. Ep.
			8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Pel. 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 36, 31, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">32, 21, 23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 6,
				417</span></i>; cf. Messana, II.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Messēnĭus</span></b> 
				(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Messā-nĭus</span></b> ), a, um,
				adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μεσσήνιος</span>,
				<i>Messeni an</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Messenia arva (al. Messania),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 679</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Messēnia</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i>the country around
				Messene</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 5, 7, §
			15</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Messēnĭi</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the Messenians</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 36, 31</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
